{"speciesId":573,"names":{"fr":"Pashmilla","es":"Cinccino","en":"Cinccino","ja":"チラチーノ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Leurs poils blancs sont recouverts d’une graisse spéciale qui leur permet d’esquiver facilement les attaques."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Their white fur is coated in a special oil that makes it easy for them to deflect attacks."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La texture de ses poils blancs est incomparable. Elle n’attire ni la poussière, ni l’électricité statique."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Their white fur feels amazing to touch. Their fur repels dust and prevents static electricity from building up."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Cinccino’s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Cinccino’s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La texture de ses poils blancs est incomparable. Elle n’attire ni la poussière, ni l’électricité statique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"El pelo que cubre su cuerpo proporciona una agradable sensación al tocarlo. No acumula ni polvo ni electricidad estática."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Their white fur feels amazing to touch. Their fur repels dust and prevents static electricity from building up."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"白い 体毛は 肌触りが 抜群。 ほこりや 静電気を まったく 寄せつけないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’une sorte de lubrifiant qui fait glisser les coups sur lui comme si de rien n’était."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"El cuerpo de Cinccino está recubierto por una grasa especial que hace que los golpes y ataques enemigos no acierten."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Cinccino’s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"チラチーノの 体は 特別な 油で 覆われており パンチなど 相手の 攻撃を 受け流す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La texture de ses poils blancs est incomparable. Elle n’attire ni la poussière, ni l’électricité statique."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El pelo que cubre su cuerpo proporciona una agradable sensación al tocarlo. No acumula ni polvo ni electricidad estática."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Their white fur feels amazing to touch. Their fur repels dust and prevents static electricity from building up."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"白い 体毛は 肌触りが 抜群。 ほこりや 静電気を まったく 寄せつけないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’une sorte de lubrifiant qui fait glisser les coups sur lui comme si de rien n’était."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El cuerpo de Cinccino está recubierto por una grasa especial que hace que los golpes y ataques enemigos no acierten."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cinccino’s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"チラチーノの 体は 特別な 油で 覆われており パンチなど 相手の 攻撃を 受け流す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Grâce à la sécrétion huileuse dont ses poils blancs sont recouverts, les attaques glissent sur sa fourrure comme sur de la soie."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Su níveo pelaje está recubierto de una sustancia oleosa, secretada por su propio cuerpo, que hace resbalar los golpes enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The white parts of its coat are covered in an oil secreted from its body, so this Pokémon can slide right away from its enemies’ attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"白い毛は 身体から しみだす 油で コーティング されており 敵の攻撃も つるりと 避ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le liquide que son corps sécrète est étrangement huileux. C’est un remède efficace pour les personnes qui ont la peau sèche."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La grasa que exuda por todo el cuerpo es muy lubrificante y altamente apreciada por las personas con problemas de piel seca."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The oil that seeps from its body is really smooth. For people troubled by bad skin, this oil is an effective treatment."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"全身から 染み出す 油は とても なめらか。 肌荒れに 悩む人にも 効果的なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il ne supporte pas de voir le moindre grain de poussière. Il utilise l’huile qu’il sécrète pour recouvrir son nid d’un revêtement protecteur."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es tan sumamente pulcro que no puede ver ni una mota de polvo. La grasa que exuda por el cuerpo le sirve de película protectora."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its body secretes oil that this Pokémon spreads over its nest as a coating to protect it from dust. Cinccino won’t tolerate even a speck of the stuff."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"塵ひとつ 許せない 潔癖。 体から 染み出る 油を 巣に 塗りつけ コーティングする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La sécrétion huileuse de ses poils lui permet de dévier les attaques. Elle s’arrache à prix d’or sur les marchés."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su pelaje está recubierto por una grasa especial que repele los ataques enemigos y por la que se llegan a pagar auténticas fortunas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"A special oil that seeps through their fur helps them avoid attacks. The oil fetches a high price at market."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"特別な 油の 染みた 毛は 攻撃を 受け流す。 油は 高値で 取り引き されている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":573,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name